      "message": "In fact, I would much prefer that `SkFunctionWrapper` be left alone in general (so that it can be used both for `sk_free` and other things in the future that may require disambiguation) and prefer to introduce something here like\n\n`template \u003cauto p\u003e using SkFunctionObject \u003d SkFunctionWrapper\u003cstd::remove_pointer_t\u003cdecltype(p)\u003e, p\u003e;`\n\nand then use `SkFunctionObject` where it can be used (when the function is not overloaded). In fact, at the same time `SkFunctionWrapper` could be renamed to `SkOverloadedFunctionWrapper`, since that\u0027s essentially the only time it would be used.",
